<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Context Propagation on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/</link><description>Recent content in Context Propagation on Splunk Observability Cloud Workshops</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Prerequisites</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/01-prerequisites/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/01-prerequisites/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Before starting this workshop, ensure you have the following tools installed and have a Splunk Observability Cloud account ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="knowledge-requirement"&gt;
 &lt;span class="heading-text"&gt;Knowledge Requirement&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#knowledge-requirement" aria-label="Permalink" aria-hidden="true"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This workshop assumes familiarity with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Kubernetes concepts (pods, deployments, services)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTTP request/response flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The idea of distributed tracing (spans, traces&amp;hellip;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenTelemetry experience is required - we&amp;rsquo;ll explain context propagation challenges as we go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="required-software"&gt;
 &lt;span class="heading-text"&gt;Required Software&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#required-software" aria-label="Permalink" aria-hidden="true"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These tools will already be installed on your instance:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Configure Environment</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/02-configure-environment/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/instrumentation/5-context-propagation/02-configure-environment/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In this step, you&amp;rsquo;ll ensure &lt;code&gt;env&lt;/code&gt; variables are configured with your Splunk Observability Cloud credentials and workshop settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="validation-checklist"&gt;
 &lt;span class="heading-text"&gt;Validation Checklist&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a class="heading-anchor" href="#validation-checklist" aria-label="Permalink" aria-hidden="true"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your environment should already have values for &lt;code&gt;INSTANCE&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CLUSTER&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;REALM&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ACCESS_TOKEN&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;RUM_TOKEN&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configure the additional required &lt;code&gt;env&lt;/code&gt; values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-block__header"&gt;
 &lt;span class="code-block__file"&gt;&lt;span class="code-block__lang"&gt;bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;DEPLOYMENT_ENV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;workshop-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;INSTANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;RUM_APP_NAME&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;workshop-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;INSTANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run &lt;code&gt;env&lt;/code&gt; command from the project root to verify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tabs" data-tabs&gt;
&lt;div class="tabs__list" role="tablist"&gt;&lt;button id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-en-ninja-workshops-instrumentation-5-context-propagation-02-configure-environment-md-22-1--0-tab-0" class="tabs__btn is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-en-ninja-workshops-instrumentation-5-context-propagation-02-configure-environment-md-22-1--0-panel-0" tabindex="0" data-tab-label="Script"&gt;Script&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-en-ninja-workshops-instrumentation-5-context-propagation-02-configure-environment-md-22-1--0-tab-1" class="tabs__btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabs---home-runner-work-observability-workshop-observability-workshop-content-en-ninja-workshops-instrumentation-5-context-propagation-02-configure-environment-md-22-1--0-panel-1" tabindex="-1" data-tab-label="Example Output"&gt;Example Output&lt;/button&gt;
